information such which party held the house,&nbsp;
senate, and presidency at any given time. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:55.200
also have a Timeline of World History, a Timeline&nbsp;
of European History as well as lots of historical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.200 --> 00:10:00.880
family trees so once again, if you’re interested&nbsp;
in learning more about any of these posters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:07.440
just head over to UsefulCharts.com or simply click&nbsp;
the link in the description or pinned comment.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:12.560
Finally, take note that from now until&nbsp;
